    Sarip","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":20}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":343.200073,"yPos":448.8},"ID":19,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Mungkin
    lain waktu bu saya mampir lagi. Ini saya lagi repot soalnya. Saya sedang mencari
    Sarip dia belum pulang dari kemarin.","parentUIDs":[18],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Ibu
    Sarip","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":21}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":340.200073,"yPos":560.800049},"ID":20,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Lho
    kenapa bisa bu? Kalau itu saya belum lihat Sarip dari kemarin","parentUIDs":[19],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Bu
    Risma","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":22}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":340.200073,"yPos":671.800049},"ID":21,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Ya
    sudah kalau begitu. Tidak apa-apa bu. Saya coba tanya ke warga yang lain dulu
    ya.","parentUIDs":[20],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Ibu
    Sarip","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":339.200073,"yPos":780.800049},"ID":22,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Baik
    bu. Semoga Sarip bisa ditemukan","parentUIDs":[21],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Bu
    Risma","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":24}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":73.20003,"yPos":-162.199966},"ID":23,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Ini
    bu saya ingin tanya. Bu Risma pernah melihat Sarip kemarin?","parentUIDs":[11],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Ibu
    Sarip","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":25}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":68.20003,"yPos":-58.2000427},"ID":24,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Kalau
    itu kurang tahu saya bu. Coba tanyakan orang-orang yang ada di pos ronda. Mungkin
    mereka tahu","parentUIDs":[23],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Bu
    Risma","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":26}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":68.20003,"yPos":49.7999573},"ID":25,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Baiklah
    kalau begitu. Saya kesana dulu ya bu. Saya lagi khawatir dengan anak saya. Entah
    kenapa firasat saya tidak enak bu.","parentUIDs":[24],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Ibu
    Sarip","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":27}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":63.2000275,"yPos":157.8},"ID":26,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Sabar
    bu. Tetap berpikir positif saja. Mungkin Sarip sedang bermain dengan teman-temannya.","parentUIDs":[25],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Bu
    Risma","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":28}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":63.2000275,"yPos":265.8},"ID":27,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Iya
    ya mungkin bu. Semoga saja dia baik-baik saja.","parentUIDs":[26],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Bu
    Risma","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":29}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":60.2000275,"yPos":367.8},"ID":28,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Kalau
    begitu saya pergi dulu ya bu","parentUIDs":[27],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Ibu
    Sarip","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":56.1999969,"yPos":475.8},"ID":29,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Iya
    bu hati-hati di jalan","parentUIDs":[28],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Bu
    Risma","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0}]}'
