    pagi pak Subagiyo","parentUIDs":[],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Ibu
    Sarip","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":13}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":387.2,"yPos":-387.1999},"ID":12,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Pagi
    Bu Rini","parentUIDs":[0],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Pak
    Subagiyo","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":14}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":388.2,"yPos":-287.199951},"ID":13,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Ada
    perlu apa kemari?","parentUIDs":[12],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Pak
    Subagiyo","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":15}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":160.2,"yPos":-287.199951},"ID":14,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Ini
    pak saya mau tanya. Kemarin malam bapak sempat melihat Sarip tidak ya?","parentUIDs":[13],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Ibu
    Sarip","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":16}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":161.2,"yPos":-171.199951},"ID":15,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Hhmm..
    Sepertinya kemarin saya melihat seperti seseorang kebetulan lewat bu.","parentUIDs":[14],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Pak
    Subagiyo","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":17}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":387.2,"yPos":-169.199951},"ID":16,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Tetapi
    dia sambil berlari membawa sesuatu. Kemudian dia sempat mampir ke rumah warga","parentUIDs":[15],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Pak
    Subagiyo","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":18}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":388.2,"yPos":-62.1999969},"ID":17,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Ya
    rencana saya mau menangkap dia. Barangkali dia pencuri.","parentUIDs":[16],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Pak
    Subagiyo","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":19}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":162.200012,"yPos":-59.1999969},"ID":18,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Tapi
    saat dihampiri dia langsung kabur bu. Dan ajaibnya di depan rumah warga itu sudah
    ada bahan makanan. Sepertinya dia ingin membagikan bahan makanan itu pada warga
    desa sini bu. ","parentUIDs":[17],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Pak
    Subagiyo","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":20}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":158.200012,"yPos":49.8000031},"ID":19,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"(Hmm
    apa mungkin itu Sarip. Tapi aku tidak terlalu yakin)","parentUIDs":[18],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Ibu
    Sarip","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":21}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":384.2,"yPos":49.8000031},"ID":20,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Bu
    Rini?","parentUIDs":[19],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Pak
    Subagiyo","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":22}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":383.2,"yPos":151.799988},"ID":21,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Oh
    ya maaf pak. Ngelamun tadi.","parentUIDs":[20],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Ibu
    Sarip","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":23}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":156.200012,"yPos":159.799988},"ID":22,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Mungkin
    saya harus bertanya sama warga yang lain.","parentUIDs":[21],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Ibu
    Sarip","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":24}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":156.200012,"yPos":263.8},"ID":23,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Tetapi
    terima kasih ya pak tadi informasinya. Semoga pelakunya bisa ditemukan.","parentUIDs":[22],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Ibu
    Sarip","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":380.2,"yPos":260.8},"ID":24,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Baik
    bu sama-sama. Semoga Sarip cepat ketemu bu.","parentUIDs":[23],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Pak
    Subagiyo","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0}]}'
